      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZING MATILDA (1) comes off an average effort last start when fifth at this track over 342m behind Stomp And Run (20.15) in a Grade 6. Placed at her previous run. Key runner on her best form. OUR BELLA ROSE (8) drifted back from wide but charged home to hit the frame when 7 lengths from the winner (20.23) at this track in Other. Expected to be in this for a long way. GOLDIE RUSTY (2) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 4 lengths into second (19.99) at Murray Bridge Straight in a Grade 6 over 350m. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Must be included in calculations. RIO HOPE (7) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot at big odds most recently.",
